, Karim","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Morten","key":"fosspau","last":"Foss","locid":"f61d562f-1a62-4249-97ad-3cffb462610a","name":"Foss, Morten","orcid":"0000-0003-0405-0681","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Ernst Martin","key":"füchtbauerpau","last":"Füchtbauer","locid":"aae550a1-5156-4de4-ac28-c6df3b08384c","name":"Füchtbauer, Ernst-Martin","name_org":"Füchtbauer, Ernst Martin","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Duncan S.","key":"sutherlandpau","last":"Sutherland","locid":"5c5c563f-ca05-4219-b60d-8a3d6303ff2f","name":"Sutherland, Duncan S","name_org":"Sutherland, Duncan S.","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["37459700"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.biomaterials.2023.122244","issn":["01429612","18785905"],"issn_org":["01429612"],"journal":"Biomaterials","paperid":"122244","publisher":"Elsevier Ltd","status":"p","title":"Biomaterials","volume":"301"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85165090857"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-362a42dd-df10-4b40-8216-3a7699d88025"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Protein ligand and nanotopography separately drive the phenotype of mouse embryonic stem cells","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-682323","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Dental biofilms consist of microorganisms embedded in an extracellular matrix that comprises a complex mixture of macromolecules, including extracellular DNA and polysaccharides. Matrix-degrading enzymes have been shown to destabilize dental biofilms and thereby contribute to caries control. The aim of this work was to test the effect of a lozenge containing a mixture of glucanase, mutanase and DNAse on biofilm formation, the development of gingivitis and the composition of the oral microbiota. 24 healthy volunteers were enrolled in a randomized, double-blind placebo-controlled study with two parallel arms. After an initial professional tooth cleaning, participants refrained from oral hygiene and used three enzyme-containing or placebo lozenges/d for 7 d. After 1 and 7 d, the Turesky-modification of the Quigley-and-Hein Plaque Index (TM-QHPI) was assessed in the first and second quadrant, respectively and compared to TM-QHPI after a one-day baseline period without oral hygiene (two-sample t-tests). At baseline and after 7 d of intervention, the gingival index (GI) was recorded and compared (two-sample t-test), and the species richness was analysed in plaque and saliva samples by 16S rRNA sequencing (linear mixed model). The protocol was approved by the local Ethics Commitee (1-10-72-260-20). Enzyme treatment resulted in a reduced mean TM-QHPI compared to control treatment after 1 d (Δ=-0.61±1.00 SD vs. 0.03±0.59 SD; p=0.07; Δ=-0.82±0.74 SD vs. -0.09±0.45 SD; p=0.01 without outliers) but not 7 d (Δ=1.03±1.42 SD vs. 1.61±1.36 SD; p=0.39), and in a reduced increase in average species richness (17±9 SE vs. 35±7 SE; p=0.04) from baseline to day 7. Mean GI did not increase over the intervention period for both treatment groups (Δ=-0.06±0.63 SD vs. 0.02±0.44 SD; p=0.39). Lozenges containing matrix-degrading enzymes may be a promising adjunct to oral hygiene.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Schlafer, Sebastian","K. Johnsen, Karina","Jørgensen, Mette-Rose","Kjærbølling, Inge","Schramm, Andreas","Meyer, Rikke Louise"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-687520"],"event":{"end":"2023-09-08","place":"Egmond aan Zee, nl","start":"2023-07-04","title":"ORCA: 70th Congress of the European Organization for Caries Research","year":"2023"},"filters":{"added":"2023-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-NOSI"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-NOSI","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the effect of an enzyme containing lozenge on dental biofilm accumulation a clinical pilot study","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-687520","ids":["au-26b01e07-d567-4765-9adb-2bcbc78ce933"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-9C2948D3191A7FC817D1DAAA176B4FDB"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Dentistry and Oral Health, Department of Dentistry and Oral Health - Section for Oral Ecology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"novonesis","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-NOSI","l3nn":"Novonesis","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Novonesis","namevar":["Novozymes A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-NOSI","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Sebastian","key":"schlaferpau","last":"Schlafer","locid":"bcd4e1fe-3a80-4288-8b5f-d105f6f53982","name":"Schlafer, Sebastian","orcid":"0000-0003-2463-1926","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Karina","key":"kjohnsenpau","last":"K. Johnsen","locid":"e6eea993-e93e-40a1-91a9-00475b587f63","name":"K. Johnsen, Karina","orcid":"0000-0002-9764-8481","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Mette-Rose","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","name":"Jørgensen, Mette-Rose","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Inge","key":"kjærbøllingpau","last":"Kjærbølling","name":"Kjærbølling, Inge","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Andreas","key":"schrammpau","last":"Schramm","locid":"25080de3-b60e-46b4-a606-d99f1ec089e5","name":"Schramm, Andreas","orcid":"0000-0002-7614-9616","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rikke Louise","key":"meyerpau","last":"Meyer","locid":"f1caa4f6-bc6e-459a-a976-8843c7ea7ff3","name":"Meyer, Rikke Louise","orcid":"0000-0002-6485-5134","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Private Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-26b01e07-d567-4765-9adb-2bcbc78ce933"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"The effect of an enzyme-containing lozenge on dental biofilm accumulation: A clinical pilot study","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-687520","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
