{"abstract":"This paper presents an empirical study and the resulting design choices from a problem-based learning (PBL) development project at Aalborg University (AAU) entitled \"Learner-Centred Moodle Course Design: Design Factors, Differences in Perceptions and Best Practices.\" In relation to this study, the following research questions are explored: What characterises the current use of Moodle at AAU? How can teachers use Moodle to support PBL activities? The empirical investigation took place in 2018 and was comprised of a literature review; a survey of 345 students’ experiences of Moodle in conjunction with a nomination for the best Moodle course; an analysis of the 178 nominated courses; and interviews with four university teachers, about their use of Moodle. During the investigation, it was found that many existing activities at AAU focus more on sharing information and teaching materials and less on the students’ PBL activities and projects. This finding is intriguing, as PBL comprise the pedagogical foundation of AAU, but use of Moodle does not reflect this. The investigation found several reasons for the lack of PBL in Moodle, and explore them in full in the paper.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Ørngreen, Rikke","Knudsen, Sara Paasch","Kolbæk, Ditte","Jensen, Rune Hagel Skaarup"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-113576"],"event":{"acronym":"ECEL","end":"2019-11-08","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2019-11-07","title":"18th European Conference on E-learning (ECEL)","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Design","Higher education","Moodle","Problem based learning PBL","Review"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Independent Researcher"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"investigating use of moodle at a pbl university design factors and experiences","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-113576","identifier":[{"id":"85077509711","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-da9aeb2c-beac-4891-a67d-6b64a3085a23"],"keyword":["Design","Higher Education","Moodle","Problem-based learning (PBL)","Review"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-03730991D039E5985A5EF075EFB4C73F"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Culture and Learning","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Culture and Learning, ILD-LAB – Research lab for IT and Learning Design","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Culture and Learning, L-ILD - IT and Learning Design","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Culture and Learning, Research Center for VidEO: Video in Education and the learning Organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Independent Researcher"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rikke","key":"ørngreenpau","last":"Ørngreen","locid":"b9c45db5-ab25-4d54-9e62-cc0bfb42ccdd","name":"Ørngreen, Rikke","orcid":"0000-0001-9042-3178","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Sara Paasch","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"0a7b040a-9581-