Meyer","locid":"f1caa4f6-bc6e-459a-a976-8843c7ea7ff3","name":"Meyer, Rikke Louise","orcid":"0000-0002-6485-5134","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Bente","key":"nyvadpau","last":"Nyvad","locid":"f0fda280-eb7a-42d4-93f0-45f26e30fc45","name":"Nyvad, Bente","orcid":"0000-0002-9545-0447","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["22398457"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1159/000336960","issn":["00086568","1421976X"],"issn_org":["00086568"],"issue":"2","journal":"Caries Research","pages":"107-112","publisher":"S. Karger AG","status":"p","title":"Caries Research","volume":"46"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84857740167"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-a2524e6c-bbe7-4b28-969b-57ed23959ac9"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Colonization of the oral cavity by probiotic bacteria","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-221820","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Oxygen consumption in marine sediments is often coupled to the oxidation of sulphide generated by degradation of organic matter in deeper, oxygen-free layers. Geochemical observations have shown that this coupling can be mediated by electric currents carried by unidentified electron transporters across centimetre-wide zones. Here we present evidence that the native conductors are long, filamentous bacteria. They abounded in sediment zones with electric currents and along their length they contained strings with distinct properties in accordance with a function as electron transporters. Living, electrical cables add a new dimension to the understanding of interactions in nature and may find use in technology development.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Pfeffer, Christian","Larsen, Steffen","Song, Jie","Dong, Mingdong","Besenbacher, Flemming","Meyer, Rikke Louise","Kjeldsen, Kasper Urup","Schreiber, Lars","Gorby, Yuri A.","El-Naggar, Mohamed Y.","Leung, Kar Man","Schramm, Andreas","Risgaard-Petersen, Nils","Nielsen, Lars Peter"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-171191"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Southern California"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"filamentous bacteria transport electrons over centimetre distances","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/nature11586","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-171191","identifier":[{"id":"23103872","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84868626806","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-4971955d-c101-47ef-bbce-83649002814c"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-BAF66F434B653F6BB96BAA0C85177094"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/nature11586","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.nature.com/nature/journal/v491/n7423/full/nature11586.html","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Biology, Department of Biology - Center for Geomicrobiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"university of southern california","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of Southern California","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian","key":"pfefferpau","last":"Pfeffer","locid":"0a46c156-5026-4324-9020-dc9b6f9c0ee3","name":"Pfeffer, Christian","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Steffen","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"6841247e-dbcd-4275-b71d-1e3cba216939","name":"Larsen, Steffen","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jie","key":"songpau","last":"Song","locid":"fc9358bf-4ff0-4160-89d4-c2c3869b8f42","name":"Song, Jie","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mingdong","key":"dongpau","last":"Dong","locid":"b54afe28-ba86-4353-9f09-6618abd83284","name":"Dong, Mingdong","orcid":"0000-0002-2025-2171","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Flemming","key":"besenbacherpau","last":"Besenbacher","locid":"0aa89800-dd75-4f15-a575-c419dda7a69f","name":"Besenbacher, Flemming","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rikke Louise","key":"meyerpau","last":"Meyer","locid":"f1caa4f6-bc6e-459a-a976-8843c7